  three TUSB8041 hubs VDD33              0.75       0.89       R   
  board E controller and sensors         0.50       0.83       D   
  board D (SA868 and logic)              0.60       0.65       D   
  board A logic                          0.50       0.57       D   
  cooler fan slot 3                      0.51       0.56       R   
